Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)怎么了……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是想传达什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在遗迹中得到的这些数字，难道是要向我传达什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((多鲁贝：很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得知骑士们谋反的英雄{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶到了城堡……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.51,0:00:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与天马之魂一同被召往了天国。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多洛瓦)曾经，这片土地上仅凭自己的双拳……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终，在众多观众面前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拳斗士被残忍地处刑了))
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道是遗迹的传说……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.88,0:00:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马：阿里特……你……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么会变成那样……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)发什么呆呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)啊…不…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)切，八成是在想那个叫阿里特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的巴利安家伙吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)啊…嗯…那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.04,0:01:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然就变了…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)事到如今还说什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙只是露出了巴利安的本性而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)本性…可是阿里特他…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.93,0:01:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)马上就要到达
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.70,0:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}点G的107，第四处遗迹了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次会是什么样的遗迹呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:01:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)这次的遗迹里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.30,0:01:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是不是也留着传说呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)说起来肯定又是悲伤的故事…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)遗迹的传说…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《快斗：银河眼在共鸣》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.05,0:01:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是 难道说……》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《多鲁贝：No.卡被藏在了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那座遗迹里 我所感受到的那个传说。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 我会知道那个传说？》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.10,0:02:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)多鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)听说你找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有 No.卡的遗迹。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)啊啊。 但很遗憾{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.81,0:02:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡被星光体们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)这可不像你。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)在 No.卡的遗迹里 我被一种难以言喻的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可思议的感觉袭扰了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)遗迹中 残留着传说。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在触碰到它的瞬间有什么东西与我的心产生了共鸣。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就像是在唤醒我的记忆一样……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.29,0:02:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，遗迹的 No.卡有7张。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.85,0:02:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而我们正是七皇。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:02:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这难道只是单纯的巧合吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)你想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道你是说，那些愚蠢的人类的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我们有关？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在比起那个，更重要的是遗迹的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝不能再让那些家伙得到更多。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)米扎艾尔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.47,0:03:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法控制！无法控制！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)游马！你给我认真点啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在认真啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！为什么？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有机器
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都受到了某种影响，无法使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)奥比塔尔！随便哪里都行。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让飞船降落！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)好……好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞艇的地图所显示的 No.遗迹坐标点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)那么说，在这座岩山上面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有 No.遗迹吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)看来，从这里开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能靠我们自己走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)哎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)看来是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)对不起，快斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身体完全不听使唤～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)这种地方爬不上去啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又得看家？ 唉……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:05:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)说得也是呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这地方可不是女孩子能爬上去的呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.31,0:06:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)没关系的小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们一起留在这里吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)啊哈！啊～太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有璃绪在的话就安心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(观测站7)一直都是俺的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.59,0:06:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)嘿 哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 我出发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)小心点啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)包在我身上 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是冒险家的儿子啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)又来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别动不动就得意忘形！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)我说啊… 别像姐姐一样说那种话啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)拿到 No.之后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要马上回来哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)交给我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.69,0:06:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)哈啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)听好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了？爬山的诀窍就是先找好落脚点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后伸出手臂 像这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.49,0:06:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有在山上互相帮助可是很重要的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不能只顾自己啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)吵死了！我才不用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你来教我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)星光 刚才那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)恐怕是 龙的咆哮。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《快斗：啊！银河眼……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 这座遗迹是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)嘿嘿 所以我说了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在山上就是要互相帮助！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)没事吧？ 游马他们。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.57,0:07:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)凯特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)没事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那三个人的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起这个，要不要吃点零食？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.01,0:07:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)会发胖的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)你说什么，圆桶！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:07:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这里是山顶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}雾太大了，什么都看不见。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)不，你仔细看看前面。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么啊，那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……不是吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种东西居然在山顶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好……好厉害～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.81,0:08:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)也许是异晶界那帮家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又设下了陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.99,0:08:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别大意！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)好香啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.09,0:08:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)喂… 喂 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)确实很香啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:08:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)是异晶界那帮家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:08:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哇啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有股好好吃味道！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(3人)什么!? 啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哦！ 哦～！ 看起来好好吃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.99,0:09:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神代)你这… 蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)好… 好痛啊！ 你干嘛啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神代)这话该我说才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然想擅自吃别人的饭…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是稍微看了一下而已啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神代)不对 你明明一副马上就要吃的样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)所以说了 不是啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神代)骗人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.61,0:09:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)才没骗人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神代)骗人 骗人 骗人 骗 骗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.85,0:09:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神代)嗯!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我的名字是快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是来寻找遗迹里的 No.卡的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)嗯？No.卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……是龙的使用者吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)啊啊。你这样的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也感受到了不寻常的气息。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然你这家伙是……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)吾名金龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是守护这 No.卡遗迹之人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.53,0:10:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你倒是有着相当不错的斗志啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.97,0:10:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}像你这样的决斗者我认识一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)很久以前，在这遗迹传说中留下记载的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与龙战斗过的决斗者……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)那个决斗者，是叫米扎艾尔的人吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)哦……遗迹的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你居然知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)等…等一下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么米扎艾尔会？那家伙应该在异晶界…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)从遗迹中回收的 No.卡记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.99,0:11:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}告诉了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.61,0:11:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们正在寻找的七张 No.卡…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与那座遗迹相关的传说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.11,0:11:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是因为那是异晶界七皇还是人类时的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}故事。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.84,0:11:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界的那帮家伙曾经是人类！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)正是如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)那…那么至今为止遗迹的传说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是德鲁贝、阿里特、贝库塔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.90,0:11:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是人类时的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.55,0:11:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)游马！鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里的决斗交给我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)快…快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.27,0:11:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.01,0:11:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并非单纯的偶然。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运……不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.60,0:11:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这应该是作为决斗者的宿命吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（神乐）好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你能赢过我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.45,0:11:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗迹的 No.卡就托付给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，如果你输了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的龙就归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯特）无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不可能会输。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:12:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（神乐）那张狂妄的嘴能撑到什么时候呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯特）决斗模式 光子变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯特）让我问一件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.21,0:12:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和遗迹传说中的米扎艾尔战斗过的是你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.33,0:12:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 米扎艾尔赢了你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.11,0:12:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（神乐）谁知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.78,0:12:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤地属性的龙召唤幻木龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有地属性怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.27,0:12:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！！水属性之龙 幻水龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 我发动幻木龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我方场上有水属性怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级可以变成两倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.27,0:13:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)一转眼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级8的怪兽就变成2只了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)来吧 好好看着！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.59,0:13:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级8的幻木龙和幻水龙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！！No.46！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}雷鸣啊 轰鸣吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪电啊 闪耀吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}显现吧 我的金色之龙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神影龙 德拉古鲁翁！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)这… 这就是这座遗迹的 No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) No.46 德拉古鲁翁…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.22,0:13:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)那就是你的龙吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.47,0:13:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)没错 是最强的龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)有意思。让我见识一下吧 那份力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 德拉古鲁翁的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上 除了这张卡以外 没有龙族怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材 从手牌特殊召唤1只龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ 武装神龙 保护龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)什么！？ No.竟然…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)德拉古鲁翁消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.23,0:14:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金龙)这是德拉古鲁翁的怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要我的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有其他龙族怪兽存在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会成为攻击以及效果的对象。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.76,0:14:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 你根本{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连我 No.怪兽的一根手指都碰不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把装备魔法「龙盾」装备给「保护龙」。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的龙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被战斗以及效果破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.15,0:14:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不会受到战斗伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:15:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 「保护龙」在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每次被装备装备魔法时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力可以提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.51,0:15:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要不把「保护龙」干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就赢不了 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)必须想办法把那张装备卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏掉才行 快斗他…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.15,0:15:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)然而 没那么容易。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动「保护龙」的进一步效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.77,0:15:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要这只怪兽以表侧表示存在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备魔法卡 魔法 陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被怪兽效果破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)那 那么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)没错 保护龙和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.21,0:15:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙之盾是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有互相守护效果的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 两边都无法被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.87,0:15:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为了铁壁般的防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神陆)我就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我的回合！ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 超量狙击手。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我再特殊召唤 超量助推者。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在自己场上有攻击力2000以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽时 可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 攻击力2000的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.15,0:16:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量狙击手和助推者解放。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在黑暗中闪耀的银河啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化作希望之光 寄宿于我仆从之身！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之化身 在此降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.45,0:16:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼·光子·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.81,0:16:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 快斗那家伙 和现在的人龙怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.38,0:16:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底要怎么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)不愧是快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就能突破那铁壁般的防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)哎？ 怎么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)忘了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼在战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将自己和敌人的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.12,0:16:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同时除外的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将保护龙除外的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙之护盾就会失去对象被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙也因此吃了不少苦头吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.69,0:17:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)原 原来如此～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.59,0:17:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)那就是你的龙吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)啊啊 这次就让你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.07,0:17:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见识见识我的龙的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.13,0:17:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)那可不好说。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.37,0:17:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)就在此刻 龙钩的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙族怪兽的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)怎么样。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你的龙就等同于被拔了牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.91,0:17:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 你要如何跨越。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这道铁壁！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.11,0:17:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)海斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.97,0:17:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)你是想筑起不可破坏的铁壁{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后看我在这面前 走投无路的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就连同那铁壁一起轰飞！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.87,0:17:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法 月之书！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将场上一只表侧表示的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为里侧守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)还有这一手啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)变成里侧守备表示的怪兽，是无法装备装备卡的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，失去了对象的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.59,0:18:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙盾会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.们再次现身了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着吧。我要把你那所谓的铁壁全部击碎{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.23,0:18:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 No.们就由我亲手猎杀。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击变成里侧守备的保护龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.61,0:18:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)呜哦～ 成功了 先制一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)这场决斗 到底……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)这就是我的做法。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.77,0:18:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有我破坏不了的墙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)这可真有趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}偏偏去破坏那些绝无可能被破坏的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给你个及格分吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.79,0:19:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)真让人不爽。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.37,0:19:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可没有被你打分的道理。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)我这是在夸你。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的龙使里头倔脾气的家伙可真多。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔也是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.03,0:19:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你现在简直一模一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和他那场决斗也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)少开玩笑了。我和那家伙不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神论)呵呵呵 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和米扎艾尔不一样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～ 真是有趣得不得了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马 你决斗的神髓
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我好好见识一下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.05,0:19:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟还有该被打破的铁壁依然残留着呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)既然如此 那就把一切
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}统统击碎便是。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《米扎艾尔：就在这里吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.27,0:20:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗迹的 No.卡就在这里》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是 龙之气焰》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神代凌牙)我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动龙·龙·龙的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.89,0:20:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上 除这张卡以外
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有龙族怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.24,0:20:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌的龙特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 金色神龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神金·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)那家伙的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现了龙 也就是说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.39,0:20:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)切 又是那个效果吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.94,0:20:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金隆)这样一来 我的 No.们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.30,0:20:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就再也无法出手干涉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.19,0:20:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 龙·龙怪的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.12,0:21:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将变为对方的生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.43,0:21:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加上这只怪兽原本的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力后的数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.85,0:21:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)你说什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的生命值是4000。 因此
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙·龙怪的攻击力上升4000。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.23,0:21:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)攻击力 8000！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(金隆)而且 这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.35,0:21:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会给予对方玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时攻击力一半的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.53,0:21:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)什 什么？ 这么说 就算
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.83,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能破坏那家伙的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.93,0:21:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也要吃下4000的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.93,0:21:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)但是 攻击力是 8000。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样挨下攻击的话 凯特他…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.73,0:21:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)不破坏那只怪兽就会输。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但照这样下去根本无法破坏它。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且那压倒性的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.05,0:21:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要突破极为困难。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对快斗来说这算是新的试炼吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.01,0:22:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(仁龙)来吧 快斗 你怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.57,0:22:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.13,0:23:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.85,0:23:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.09,0:23:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.85,0:23:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.75,0:23:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:23:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.45,0:23:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.65,0:24:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.66,0:24:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.06,0:24:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
